            <tbody><tr class="tr"><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">瓶颈从构建转向周边阶段</td><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">“Code is no longer the bottleneck” 开篇与六阶段概述</td><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">原文主张</td></tr><tr class="tr"><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">用 <code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">intent.md</code> 串起工作流</td><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">Stage 1: Plan，以及监控和安全扫描的回流说明</td><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">原文做法</td></tr><tr class="tr"><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">分层响应和受限动作</td><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">Continuous monitoring play、<code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #d14; background: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">bands.yaml</code> 示例</td><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">原文示例</td></tr><tr class="tr"><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">定期安全扫描与置信度</td><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">Recurring codebase scans、Claude Security 段落</td><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">厂商产品叙述</td></tr><tr class="tr"><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">Slack 事故响应与知识沉淀</td><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">Claude on call with Claude Tag</td><td class="td" style="border: 1px solid #dfdfdf; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; color: #3f3f3f; word-break: keep-all;">厂商产品叙述</td></tr></tbody>
